# Line-ending policy (Step 15 lesson, seen live): the production image
# execve's backend/deploy/docker-entrypoint.sh, and a CRLF checkout makes the
# kernel fail with "no such file or directory" the moment a container starts.
# core.autocrlf=true (Windows) otherwise rewrites *.sh with CRLF on every
# checkout/merge.
*.sh text eol=lf
